                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B_{{}_{\sqcup}\!} Conf(\mathbb{R}^D)
              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"} delooping
