          %p Using this one may deduce that:
          %p
          #CnfSpaceOfPointsInPlaneIsEMSpace.num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              %strong (configuration space of points in plane is EM-space of braid group)
              %br/
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type"} homotopy type
              of a configuration space of points in the
