          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#FarberGrant08"}> Farber &amp; Grant 08, Theorem 1
            )
          %h3#OrderedUnlabeledConfigurationsFromUnorderedLabeledConfigurations Ordered unlabeled configurations from unordered labeled configurations
          %blockquote
