          #RealCohomologyOfConfigurationSpaceInTermsOfGraphCohomology.num_remark
            %h6#remark_5 Remark
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+cohomology"} real cohomology
                of the configuration space in terms of
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/graph+cohomology"} graph cohomology
            %p
              In the
