              2 (1991) 509-528 (
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1112/jlms/s2-43.3.509"}> doi:10.1112/jlms/s2-43.3.509
              )
          %p
            In the context of speculations regarding
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Galois+theory"} Galois theory
