              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sphere+spectrum"} sphere spectrum
          %ul
            %li#MoravaBeardsly17
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jack+Morava"}> Jack Morava
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Beardsley"} Jonathan Beardsley
              = succeed "," do
                %em Toward a Galois theory of the integers over the sphere spectrum
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.05992"} arXiv:1710.05992
          %h3#stable_splitting_of_mapping_spaces_2 Stable splitting of mapping spaces
          %p
            The appearance of configuration spaces as summands in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+splittings+of+mapping+spaces"} stable splittings of mapping spaces
