              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/S030500410005742X"} doi:10.1017/S030500410005742X
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.cambridge.org/core/services/aop-cambridge-core/content/view/247D9F951F8AB99000E4FF6CB2DB9EA2/S030500410005742Xa.pdf/div-class-title-stable-proofs-of-stable-splittings-div.pdf"} pdf
          %p Review and generalization is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#Boedigheimer87"} Boedigheimer 87
          %p
            and the relation to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goodwillie-Taylor+tower"} Goodwillie-Taylor tower
            of mapping spaces is pointed out in
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#Arone99"} Arone 99
          %h3#ReferencesInGoodwillieCalculus In Goodwillie-calculus
          %p
            The configuration spaces of a space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            appear as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goodwillie+derivatives"} Goodwillie derivatives
            of its
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mapping+space"} mapping space
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+cohomology"} nonabelian cohomology
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functor"} functor
            = succeed ":" do
