                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rainald+Flume"} Rainald Flume
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      The four-point correlations of all primary operators of the
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
